{"id":"n82407-1-11","stage":5,"title":"파악 · 掌握","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n82407-1-11-1","ko":"오늘 회사에 첫 출근을 한 소감이 어때?","zh":"今天是第一次来公司上班，有什么感想吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"오늘","meaning":"今天，今日","explanation":"오늘：今天，今日。","readings":[{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68206","senseId":"1","lemma":"오늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}},{"text":"회사에","meaning":"公司，企业，会社","explanation":"회사：公司，企业，会社；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"회사","audio":"/audio/a109dcd7f6f11c2e1703.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31668","senseId":"1","lemma":"회사","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"회사에","audio":"/audio/b40802e07b0e88855c61.mp3"}},{"text":"첫","meaning":"首次，初次，第一次","explanation":"첫：首次，初次，第一次。","readings":[{"term":"첫","audio":"/audio/9195c91a6f506a7d56aa.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"77610","senseId":"1","lemma":"첫","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"첫","audio":"/audio/9195c91a6f506a7d56aa.mp3"}},{"text":"출근을","meaning":"上班","explanation":"출근：上班；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"출근","audio":"/audio/0ece90941e0c8568c6d5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72139","senseId":"1","lemma":"출근","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"출근을","audio":"/audio/98a0d0d8de0a9036f5d9.mp3"}},{"text":"한","meaning":"以某种方式构成行为。","explanation":"하다：以某种方式构成行为；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"25","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"한","audio":"/audio/89233692031a62c60e6e.mp3"}},{"text":"소감이","meaning":"感想","explanation":"소감：感想；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"소감","audio":"/audio/a0e303ba81b3fd1b2496.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64299","senseId":"1","lemma":"소감","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"소감이","audio":"/audio/894d29a0809338cfbb05.mp3"}},{"text":"어때?","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어때","audio":"/audio/b8638c1eedbc8ab7e09d.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"3bc6235e1d18162f","term":"오늘","zh":"今天，今日","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3","entryId":"68206","definition":"现在正在度过的这一天。","pronunciation":["오늘"]},{"id":"a109dcd7f6f11c2e","term":"회사","zh":"公司，企业，会社","audio":"/audio/a109dcd7f6f11c2e1703.mp3","entryId":"31668","definition":"想要通过事业获得利益的许多人一起建立的法人团体。","pronunciation":["회ː사","훼ː사"]},{"id":"9195c91a6f506a7d","term":"첫","zh":"首次，初次，第一次","audio":"/audio/9195c91a6f506a7d56aa.mp3","entryId":"77610","definition":"最初的。","pronunciation":["첟"]},{"id":"0ece90941e0c8568","term":"출근","zh":"上班","audio":"/audio/0ece90941e0c8568c6d5.mp3","entryId":"72139","definition":"去单位工作。","pronunciation":["출근"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"以某种方式构成行为。","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"以某种方式构成行为。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"a0e303ba81b3fd1b","term":"소감","zh":"感想","audio":"/audio/a0e303ba81b3fd1b2496.mp3","entryId":"64299","definition":"对某事的感觉或想法。","pronunciation":["소ː감"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]}],"audio":"/audio/6aa961b048920a590331.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n82407-1-11-2","ko":"아직 업무 파악 중이라 얼떨떨해요.","zh":"我还在熟悉工作内容，所以还有点懵。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아직","meaning":"尚未，还，仍然","explanation":"아직：尚未，还，仍然。","readings":[{"term":"아직","audio":"/audio/fc3d924ec6725c21b50b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71254","senseId":"1","lemma":"아직","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아직","audio":"/audio/fc3d924ec6725c21b50b.mp3"}},{"text":"업무","meaning":"业务","explanation":"업무：业务。","readings":[{"term":"업무","audio":"/audio/1377bb69d5f7d43cea77.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62461","senseId":"1","lemma":"업무","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"업무","audio":"/audio/1377bb69d5f7d43cea77.mp3"}},{"text":"파악","meaning":"掌握，把握，了解","explanation":"파악：掌握，把握，了解。","readings":[{"term":"파악","audio":"/audio/d0a5f170eef42e18b8c3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"82407","senseId":"1","lemma":"파악","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"파악","audio":"/audio/d0a5f170eef42e18b8c3.mp3"}},{"text":"중이라","meaning":"处在某状态的期间。","explanation":"중：处在某状态的期间；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；라：连接名词判断、引用内容或相应的后续表达。","readings":[{"term":"중","audio":"/audio/b558d7af71515538c58a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79404","senseId":"3","lemma":"중","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"중이라","audio":"/audio/6e3240918a2791cfe204.mp3"}},{"text":"얼떨떨해요.","meaning":"不知所措，发懵","explanation":"얼떨떨하다：不知所措，发懵；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"얼떨떨하다","audio":"/audio/9b55da31670403c6794a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67306","senseId":"1","lemma":"얼떨떨하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"얼떨떨해요","audio":"/audio/b6babc3823b5d2c0a38b.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"fc3d924ec6725c21","term":"아직","zh":"尚未，还，仍然","audio":"/audio/fc3d924ec6725c21b50b.mp3","entryId":"71254","definition":"表示某事或状态成为怎么样需要过一段时间， 或者某事或状态不结束继续不断。","pronunciation":["아직"]},{"id":"1377bb69d5f7d43c","term":"업무","zh":"业务","audio":"/audio/1377bb69d5f7d43cea77.mp3","entryId":"62461","definition":"在职场等担任的事情。","pronunciation":["엄무"]},{"id":"d0a5f170eef42e18","term":"파악","zh":"掌握，把握，了解","audio":"/audio/d0a5f170eef42e18b8c3.mp3","entryId":"82407","definition":"确切理解而弄懂某事或某个对象的内容或状况。","pronunciation":["파악"]},{"id":"b558d7af71515538","term":"중","zh":"处在某状态的期间。","audio":"/audio/b558d7af71515538c58a.mp3","entryId":"79404","definition":"处在某状态的期间。","pronunciation":["중"]},{"id":"9b55da31670403c6","term":"얼떨떨하다","zh":"不知所措，发懵","audio":"/audio/9b55da31670403c6794a.mp3","entryId":"67306","definition":"因意外的事惊惶或因多件事十分复杂而不知该怎么办。","pronunciation":["얼떨떨하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/0f7e71cc11f5f6289a20.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.498,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=82407","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":168,"sequenceScore":3.3247,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["今天是第一次来公司上班，有什么感想吗？","我还在熟悉工作内容，所以还有点懵。","我真的很喜欢鱼。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["今天是第一次来公司上班，有什么感想吗？","我还在熟悉工作内容，所以还有点懵。","我真的很喜欢鱼。"],"answer":1}]}
